v 3
d 'SPINESX': Classify spine procedures from CPT/HCPCS codes
d
d Classifies CPT/HCPCS codes into 18 spine procedure groups and vertebral
d regions, and estimates the minimum and maximum number of levels fused
d and decompressed. Designed for outpatient data such as the HCUP
d Nationwide Ambulatory Surgery Sample (NASS).
d
d Requires Stata 16 or later.
d
d Author: Brook I. Martin, PhD, MPH
d Department of Orthopaedics, University of Utah
d Support: Brook.Martin@hsc.utah.edu
d
d Version 2.2
d Distribution-Date: 20261105
d
f spinesx.ado
f spinesx.sthlp
F spinesx_codes.csv
f spinesx_test.do
